Hi Tom,

Following files are used in C2:

/tcb/files/auth.db            Authentication password profile for each user

/etc/auth/system/            Default values for database fields

/etc/auth/system/ttys       Security information about each terminal

/etc/auth/system/files       Protection attributes of each system file

/etc/auth/system/devassign    Login and X terminals

Cheers,  Igor




