I'm not familiar with that particular system, but I'll hazard a
guess and suggest that you're having trouble with NIS/shadow passwd
interactions (or, more specificly, lack thereof). I expect that if
you dig into the "C2" documentation you'll find either a
recommendation that C2 and NIS not be used together, or directions
on what you should do. You may have to have an /etc/shadow file
on each machine.

